      "y": 605,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 44,
      "text": "Clark also gates routes in Routes.js (officer/admin). SCEvents enforces the same levels in pkg/middleware/auth.go.\nAll calls go through Clark/src/APIFunctions/SCEvents.js using SCEvents.BASE_URL.",
